COMMENTS :
This is the unique contruction unit.
It permits to level down an area before
a building can be erected.
This is also the only device able to
capture an ennemy head quarter and
thus to acquire ennemy technology.
Keep in mind : bulldozer is a key unit,
allways keep a factory operationnal
with sufficient resources to produce at
least one bulldozer.%.